OL,3,GNEWSAPeople who want to live on this
OL,4,Aalmost-empty estate aren't allowed to
OL,5,Abuy the homes
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn almost empty new build estate has
OL,8,Fsparked anger because rules state that
OL,9,Fthe houses can be only sold as holiday
OL,10,Fhomes, with one would-be buyer saying
OL,11,Fher grandparents would be "turning in
OL,12,Ftheir graves".
OL,14,FParc Delfryn, Brynteg, is two miles
OL,15,Ffrom the Anglesey coast and home to the
OL,16,Fsecond highest rate of holiday home
OL,17,Fusers, external in Wales for its
OL,18,Fpopulation size, yet 14 of the 16
OL,19,Fhouses have not been sold since 2023.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
