OL,3,GNEWSAPeople who want to live on this
OL,4,Aalmost-empty estate aren't allowed to
OL,5,Abuy the homes
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut planning restrictions imposed
OL,8,Fbefore construction began mean they
OL,9,Fcannot be sold to people who want to
OL,10,Flive there and a challenge to the rules
OL,11,Ffailed.
OL,13,FAnglesey council said changing rules
OL,14,Fwould "set a dangerous precedent" for
OL,15,Fholiday homes approved around the
OL,16,Fisland.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
